DISTRIBUTION GENERATOR README

ABOUT

	later

REQUIREMENTS

	libpqxx 4.0.1: a C++ connector for Postgres.

INSTALLATION

	Retrieve the source for libpqxx, build, and install the library:

		$ wget http://pqxx.org/download/software/libpqxx/libpqxx-4.0.1.tar.gz
		$ ./configure && make && sudo make install
	
	The include and lib files should have been installed to /usr/local/include
	and /usr/local/lib respectively.
	After installing installing libpqxx, you can build the distribution
	generator:

		$ make

